          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On November 26th between 7:15 and 8:15, a witness observed for nearly an hour a yellow ball that seemed to be burning up. After an hour, the ball quickly departed, leaving behind a black trail. The investigation was unable to identify the ball as a civilian or military aircraft, or a balloon. The phenomenon remains unexplained.",
